  # ChatGPT vs Claude vs Gemini: Which AI Is Actually Best in 2026?
  
  [![AI Unfiltered](https://miro.medium.com/v2/resize:fill:64:64/1*93x1F0nd_p8gzrcCp08P5w.jpeg)](https://unfilteredai.medium.com/?source=post_page---byline--59a50c70dcdb---------------------------------------)
  
