  - **Procter & Gamble** – Piloted Copilot in HR for resume screening and interview prep, reducing manager time by 40%.
  - (Sources: Microsoft Cloud Blog and News releases ( [\[51\]](https://blogs.microsoft.com/blog/2025/02/05/https-blogs-microsoft-com-blog-2024-11-12-how-real-world-businesses-are-transforming-with-ai/#:~:text=11,information%20and%20guidance%20to%20employees "Highlights: 11,information and guidance to employees")) ( [\[17\]](https://www.microsoft.com/en-us/microsoft-cloud/blog/2025/07/24/ai-powered-success-with-1000-stories-of-customer-transformation-and-innovation/?msockid=039e8bdc0ba064b42e529d2b0aae6555#:~:text=Council%20of%20the%20Year%20in,to%20achieve%20more%20with%20fewer "Highlights: Council of the Year in,to achieve more with fewer")) ( [\[5\]](https://blogs.microsoft.com/blog/2025/02/05/https-blogs-microsoft-com-blog-2024-11-12-how-real-world-businesses-are-transforming-with-ai/#:~:text=13,and%20the%20Azure%20ecosystem%20to "Highlights: 13,and the Azure ecosystem to")) ( [\[50\]](https://www.microsoft.com/en-us/microsoft-cloud/blog/2025/07/24/ai-powered-success-with-1000-stories-of-customer-transformation-and-innovation/?msockid=039e8bdc0ba064b42e529d2b0aae6555#:~:text=144,to%20build%20a%20solution%20that "Highlights: 144,to build a solution that")), WindowsCentral/Techradar reports).
  
