  # The best large language models (LLMs) in 2026
  
  ## These are the most significant, interesting, and popular LLMs you can use right now.
  
  By Harry Guinness · March 5, 2026
  
  [Share article on X](https://x.com/intent/post?url=https://zapier.com/blog/best-llm/ "Share article on X")[Share article on LinkedIn](https://www.linkedin.com/sharing/share-offsite?url=https://zapier.com/blog/best-llm/ "Share article on LinkedIn")[Share article on Reddit](https://www.reddit.com/submit?url=https://zapier.com/blog/best-llm/ "Share article on Reddit")
  
